option.AUTO_EXPOSURE.comment=Meters scene brightness and gradually adapts using a persistent exposure history. Applies in Vibrant Visuals.
option.VOLUMETRIC_SAMPLES.comment=Shadow-tested atmospheric light samples. Zero disables rays. Overworld only, within shadow distance.
option.SKY_REFLECTIONS.comment=Sky reflection fallback for smooth materials when screen-space reflections miss.
option.WATER_CAUSTICS.comment=Brighter world-pixel-aligned light patterns on submerged surfaces, visible above and below water. Applies in Vibrant Visuals.

option.COLOR_GRADING.comment=Normal keeps the Miniature palette. Vibrant Visuals enables HDR exposure, atmosphere, bloom, contact occlusion, sky reflections and improved water. Quality controls effect cost.
option.FOG_HEIGHT.comment=World height around which atmospheric fog is densest. Higher terrain receives less fog. Vibrant Visuals only.
option.FOG_DENSITY.comment=Atmospheric fog density multiplier. Environmental fog keeps separate controls.
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Brightness multiplier before highlight compression. Vibrant Visuals only.
option.SSAO_SAMPLES.comment=Depth-based contact occlusion samples. Zero disables the effect. Vibrant Visuals only.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Screen-space glow around bright lighting and emissive surfaces. Zero disables bloom. Vibrant Visuals only.
option.WATER_ABSORPTION.comment=Strength of depth-dependent water color attenuation and opacity. Vibrant Visuals only.

option.CAUSTICS_PIXELS=Caustics Pixels per Block
option.CAUSTICS_PIXELS.comment=Locks the caustic pattern to a world-space pixel grid. Use 16 for vanilla pixel density.

option.EXPOSURE_MIN=Minimum Adaptive Exposure
option.EXPOSURE_MAX=Maximum Adaptive Exposure
option.EXPOSURE_SPEED=Exposure Adaptation Speed

option.NETHER_FOG_DISTANCE=Nether Fog Distance
option.NETHER_FOG_DISTANCE.comment=Controls Nether atmospheric haze independently of Minecraft and DH render distance. Lower values give denser fog.
option.NETHER_AMBIENCE=Nether Ambient Fill
option.NETHER_AMBIENCE.comment=Restores diffuse ambient light tinted by the current Nether biome fog color. Zero disables the extra fill.

option.END_FOG_DISTANCE=End Fog Distance
option.END_FOG_DISTANCE.comment=Controls purple End atmosphere independently of normal and DH view distance. Lower values give denser haze.
option.END_AMBIENCE=End Ambient Fill
option.END_AMBIENCE.comment=Adjusts purple diffuse ambient lighting in the End.
option.END_SKY_GLOW=End Sky Glow
option.END_SKY_GLOW.comment=Strength of the subtle purple End sky backdrop. Star amount, opacity and animation use the End Stars controls.

option.DIMENSION_VOLUMETRICS=Dimension Volumetric Fog
option.DIMENSION_VOLUMETRICS.comment=Ray-marched moving density fog, stopped by Minecraft and DH scene depth. Vibrant Visuals only. Quality zero uses simple fog.
option.DIMENSION_FOG_STRENGTH=Dimension Volumetric Density
option.DIMENSION_FOG_STRENGTH.comment=Density multiplier for End and Sift volumetric fog. Their Fog Distance controls also apply. Zero restores simple dimension fog.

screen.SIFT_SCREEN=The Sift Atmosphere
option.SIFT_AMBIENCE=Sift Ambient Fill
option.SIFT_FOG_DISTANCE=Sift Fog Distance
option.SIFT_MIST_HEIGHT=Sift Mist Height
option.SIFT_SKY_GLOW=Sift Sky Glow
option.SIFT_GLOW=Sift Bloom Multiplier
option.SIFT_FOG_DISTANCE.comment=Distance scale for cyan/violet haze in Mielon's Sift. Volumetric quality and dimension volumetric toggle apply.

option.WATER_VOLUMETRICS=Volumetric Water Fog
option.WATER_VOLUMETRICS.comment=Depth-limited absorption and moving ambient scattering. Normal/High ray march; Low/Lowest use a cheaper uniform fog.
option.WATER_FOG_DENSITY=Water Fog Density
option.WATER_SCATTERING=Water Ambient Scattering

option.CLOUD_SHADOWS=Cloud Shadows
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS.comment=Projects the active cloud texture along the sunlight direction onto nearby and DH terrain. Requires Shadows. Drift is approximated; disable when clouds are hidden.
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_STRENGTH=Cloud Shadow Strength
option.CLOUD_SHADOW_HEIGHT=Cloud Shadow Height

option.SIFT_LIGHT_SHAFTS=Sift Light Shafts
option.SIFT_LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Warm world-space ambient shafts with nearby shadow-map occlusion. Normal/High and Vibrant Visuals only. Zero disables.
option.SIFT_MOTES=Sift Luminous Motes
option.SIFT_MOTES.comment=Depth-limited shader motes. Normal/High and Vibrant Visuals only. Zero disables.


option.LABPBR_METAL_FACTOR=Metal Factor
option.LABPBR_METAL_FACTOR.comment=Scales metallic response from the selected material mode. Zero treats metals as dielectrics.

option.END_FLASH_SKY=End Flash Sky Rift
option.END_FLASH_SKY.comment=Purple-white rift and sky glow synchronized to Minecraft's End flash. Visible in the native flash direction and masked by terrain, including DH. Requires Sky enabled.
option.END_FLASH_STRENGTH=End Flash Sky Strength

option.SUN_BLOOM_STRENGTH=Sun Bloom Strength
option.SUN_BLOOM_STRENGTH.comment=Sun-only HDR brightness feeding scene bloom. Vibrant Visuals only; Bloom Strength must be above zero. Zero restores the native sun brightness.

option.MATERIAL_MODE=Material Mode
value.MATERIAL_MODE.0=Integrated PBR
value.MATERIAL_MODE.1=labPBR 1.3
option.MATERIAL_MODE.comment=Integrated uses built-in block rules and your color textures. labPBR reads normal and specular textures from a compatible resource pack. Quality profiles preserve this selection.
option.INTEGRATED_EMISSION=Integrated Emission
option.INTEGRATED_METALS=Integrated Metallic Finish
option.CAUSTICS_SCALE=Caustics Scale
option.CAUSTICS_SPEED=Caustics Animation Speed
option.CAUSTICS_POWER=Caustics Edge Contrast
screen.LABPBR_SCREEN=labPBR Texture Controls
screen.LIGHTING_SCREEN=Lighting & Reflections
screen.CAUSTICS_SCREEN=Water Caustics
screen.WATER_FOG_SCREEN=Underwater Fog
screen.DIMENSIONS_SCREEN=Dimension Effects
screen.NETHER_SCREEN=Nether
screen.END_SCREEN=The End
screen.PERFORMANCE_SCREEN=Quality & Performance

option.PORTAL_EMISSION=Portal Emission
option.PORTAL_EMISSION.comment=HDR emission for mapped portals. Custom portal renderers must expose their block identity to Iris.

option.SUNSET_BLOOM_BOOST=Sunset Bloom Boost
option.SUNSET_BLOOM_BOOST.comment=Maximum bloom multiplier near dusk in the Overworld. Fades smoothly with solar elevation and rain; daytime and deep night keep normal bloom strength.

option.GLASS_REFLECTION_STRENGTH=Glass Reflections
option.GLASS_REFLECTION_STRENGTH.comment=Reflection strength for clear and stained glass blocks/panes. Preserves texture alpha; Fresnel keeps face-on views transparent.

profile.ULTRA=Ultra

option.COLORED_GLASS_SHADOWS=Colored Glass Shadows
option.WATER_SCENE_REFLECTIONS=Water Scene Reflections
option.WATER_SCENE_REFLECTIONS.comment=Screen-space scene reflections can change with the view. Off uses stable sky reflections in Vibrant mode.
option.WATER_SUN_GLINT=Water Sun Glint

option.WATER_TEXTURE_OVERLAY=Textured Water Highlights
option.WATER_TEXTURE_OVERLAY.comment=Mask sun and moon reflections with animated water texture pixels. No separate texture overlay. DH retains a smooth reflection.

option.WATER_MOON_GLINT=Water Moon Glint
option.WATER_MOON_GLINT.comment=Weaker lunar reflection, attenuated by moon elevation, phase, rain and shadows.

option.CAVE_AMBIENT=Cave Ambient Brightness
option.CAVE_AMBIENT.comment=Minimum ambient fill in low-skylight Overworld areas.

option.TWILIGHT_RAYS=Sunrise / Sunset Rays
option.TWILIGHT_RAYS.comment=Warm shadow-shaped sun shafts near the horizon. Requires Vibrant grading, fog, shadows, and volumetric samples.
option.TWILIGHT_RAY_STRENGTH=Twilight Ray Strength



screen.PACK_COMPATIBILITY_SCREEN=Texture Pack Compatibility
option.PACK_OUTLINE_MARKERS=Enchantment Outline Alpha Markers
option.PACK_OUTLINE_MARKERS.comment=Support unlit item texels with alpha 200, 252 or 253, used by Enchantment Outlines. Disable if an unrelated texture uses those opacity values.
option.PACK_FULLBRIGHT_ENTITIES=Fullbright Entity Overlays
option.PACK_FULLBRIGHT_ENTITIES.comment=Honor fullbright entity draws used by ETF emissive overlays. Disable if a mod draws ordinary entity layers with fullbright lighting.


option.LAMB_DYNAMIC_LIGHTS=LambDynamicLights Compatibility
option.LAMB_DYNAMIC_LIGHTS.comment=Use the mod lightmap for dynamic lighting. Disables shader held-item lights to prevent duplication. Keeps emissive textures and colored static block lights. Enable only when LambDynamicLights is installed.

option.BIOME_ATMOSPHERE=Biome Atmosphere
option.BIOME_ATMOSPHERE.comment=Subtle biome sky and fog palettes with smooth transitions. Preserves native brightness and weather; resource-pack and mod colors are blended. DH cloud colors are controlled by DH.
option.BIOME_ATMOSPHERE_STRENGTH=Biome Atmosphere Strength

option.WATER_CDOM=Water CDOM Concentration
option.WATER_CDOM.comment=Organic matter absorption: more produces yellow/brown water. RGB approximation; not an exact Bedrock renderer.
option.WATER_CHLOROPHYLL=Water Chlorophyll Concentration
option.WATER_CHLOROPHYLL.comment=More produces greener water by absorbing red and blue light.
option.WATER_SEDIMENT=Water Suspended Sediment
option.WATER_SEDIMENT.comment=More produces murkier red/brown water.
option.WATER_BIOME_COLOR=Biome Water Color Contribution

option.WATER_VOLUMETRIC_SAMPLES=Water Volumetric Quality
option.WATER_VOLUMETRIC_SAMPLES.comment=Samples for water fog and sunlight shafts, independent of atmospheric volumetrics. Zero uses uniform water fog without shafts. Maximum 128.

option.WATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS=Water Light Shafts
option.WATER_LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Underwater sunlight shafts. Enabled by the Ultra preset; disabled by other presets.
